  <!--EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. If the festive feast is fun or unforgettable, varying festive favor amounts will be given for each participant.-->
  <VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.description>根据仪式的质量，参与者将获得持续 4 小时到 3 天的娱乐提升，这将提高他们的娱乐标准。他们的情绪也会在 {MOODDAYS} 天内处于 {MINMOOD} 和 {MAXMOOD} 之间。

仪式篝火将持续点燃至少两个方格，提供附近的美丽奖励，并计入“火：所需戒律”周围的火的数量。</VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.description>
  <!--EN: The {0} was terrible. The food was disgusting and we just quarreled and bickered through all of it.-->
  <VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0} 太糟糕了！一些可怜的小火焰四处飘荡，但它们很快就消失了（没有应用娱乐效果）。</VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!--EN: Terrible-->
  <VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was boring. We just went throught he motions, without putting much heart into it. The food was a bit bland.-->
  <VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0} 表现平淡。我们原以为会发生一场奇妙的大火，但结果却是一场超大的篝火。至少还算有趣。

所有参与者的娱乐时间将提高4小时。</VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!--EN: Boring-->
  <VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>黯淡无光</VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was super fun. Gathering together to share a festive feast really enhances the spirit of the season.-->
  <VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0} 很好。定居点上空熊熊燃烧，火焰噼啪作响，极大地振奋了我们的士气。

所有参与者的娱乐活动将提高 1 天。</VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!--EN: Fun-->
  <VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>好的</VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!--EN: The {0} was unforgettable! We truly felt like a big family and the food was just simply amazing!-->
  <VCE_FestiveFeastOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0} 太棒了！这非常有趣，我们通过共同的经历真正建立了联系。

